    <string-array name="tour_bodies">
        <item>The magnet is inside this white shell. This bore is %1$d cm wide; your head will be in its middle.</item>
        <item>You lie on this table. It slides you slowly into the bore, and back out at the end.</item>
        <item>An open cage around your head that picks up the signal. It is open in front of your face.</item>
        <item>Squeeze it whenever you want to stop. Here, hold the trigger or pinch and hold — try it.</item>
        <item>The technologist watches through this window and talks to you through the speaker on the gantry.</item>
    </string-array>
